              "value": "Wear Skin"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(manipulate)\n\nThe ecorche wears the skin as a disguise.\n\nIt assumes the creature's size, appearance, and voice. Wearing Skin counts as creating a disguise for the Impersonate use of Deception.\n\nThe ecorche's transformation automatically defeats Perception DCs to determine whether it's a member of the ancestry or creature type into which it transformed, and the ecorche gains a +4 status bonus to its Deception DC to prevent others from seeing through its disguise.\n\nWearing a skin gives the ecorche a +2 item bonus to AC and 75 temporary"
